<section
  class='fullscreen-section'
  id='services'
  data-title='Services — Brand, UX/UI & Front-End | Katja Turnsek'
  data-description='Brand identity, UX/UI design, web design, and front-end development for businesses, agencies, and creative teams.'
>
  <div class='rows'>
    <div class='row'>
      <h1>Services</h1>
      <h2>Clear visual direction, thoughtful UX, and a website that works.</h2>

      <p class='align-right-60'>
        I help small businesses, creative teams, and agencies turn ideas into
        <strong>coherent brands and useful digital experiences</strong>. You can bring me in for one
        focused task or for a project that moves from visual direction through design and front-end
        implementation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class='services-grid row' aria-label='Main services'>
      <article class='service-card'>
        <p class='service-number' aria-hidden='true'>01</p>
        <h3>Brand Identity &amp; Visual Direction</h3>

        <p>
          A clear visual foundation that helps your business look recognisable, consistent, and
          credible.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Logos and visual identities</li>
          <li>Colours, typography, and visual systems</li>
          <li>Creative direction</li>
          <li>Brand and website consistency</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class='service-card'>
        <p class='service-number' aria-hidden='true'>02</p>
        <h3>UX/UI &amp; Web Design</h3>

        <p>
          Responsive interfaces that make important actions easy to find and the experience easy to
          understand.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Website and landing-page design</li>
          <li>Wireframes and responsive Figma designs</li>
          <li>User journeys and interface improvements</li>
          <li>Accessibility and mobile usability</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class='service-card'>
        <p class='service-number' aria-hidden='true'>03</p>
        <h3>Front-End Development</h3>

        <p>
          Careful implementation that keeps the design responsive, accessible, and maintainable.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Responsive website implementation</li>
          <li>Figma-to-code development</li>
          <li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and TypeScript</li>
          <li>Reusable components and API integrations</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class='row starter-services'>
      <div>
        <p class='eyebrow'>A practical place to start</p>
        <h3>Smaller, clearly defined services</h3>
      </div>

      <ul class='service-pills' aria-label='Starter services'>
        <li>Website and UX review</li>
        <li>Homepage redesign</li>
        <li>Landing-page design</li>
        <li>Mobile usability improvement</li>
        <li>Existing website refresh</li>
        <li>Brand and website consistency review</li>
        <li>Figma-to-responsive-code implementation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class='row process-section'>
      <p class='eyebrow'>How we work together</p>
      <h3>A simple process from first conversation to handover</h3>

      <ol class='process-list'>
        <li>
          <span>Discovery</span>
          <small>Goals, audience, scope, and practical needs</small>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>Direction</span>
          <small>Priorities, visual approach, and project plan</small>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>Design</span>
          <small>Structure, interface, and responsive details</small>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>Build</span>
          <small>Front-end implementation when included</small>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>Testing &amp; handover</span>
          <small>Final checks, files, and clear next steps</small>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class='row services-trust'>
      <p>
        Projects can begin with one focused service and grow only when it makes sense. I work in
        <strong>English and Swedish</strong>, speak some Slovenian, and collaborate with clients in
        Slovenia, Sweden, and remotely across Europe.
      </p>

      <div class='page-actions'>
        <a href='{{base}}#contact' class='label-link'>
          <span class='label-text'>Discuss a project</span>
          <svg class='icon icon-18 arrow-icon' aria-hidden='true'>
            <use href='#i-arrow-right' />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a href='{{base}}#work' class='label-link'>
          <span class='label-text'>View my work</span>
          <svg class='icon icon-18 arrow-icon' aria-hidden='true'>
            <use href='#i-arrow-right' />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='back-to-work-container'>
      <a
        href='{{base}}'
        class='label-link back-to-work-label'
        data-back
        data-back-fallback='{{base}}'
        aria-label='Go back'
      >
        <svg class='icon icon-18 arrow-icon' aria-hidden='true'>
          <use href='#i-arrow-left' />
        </svg>

        <span class='label-text'>Back to Home</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>